    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrors to Unveil is a series-based psychological horror game that immerses players in disturbing stories, each one unraveling the terrifying stories of those who lived to tell their experiences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first episode of Terrors to Unveil is free to play, more episodes are coming soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is the first episode in the series:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716700/extras/65ca632b50e9ff6289ddf144f433f94e.poster.avif?t=1748700692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716700/extras/65ca632b50e9ff6289ddf144f433f94e.webm?t=1748700692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716700/extras/65ca632b50e9ff6289ddf144f433f94e.mp4?t=1748700692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 1:\u00a0</strong>Terrors to Unveil - Intrusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David Hopster, a 15-year-old high school student, has just been left home alone for the weekend while his parents head out of town. At first, everything seemed normal. He spent the day enjoying his freedom. But by nightfall, strange things started happening.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity.</p></li></ul>",
